{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：18:47 2026-11-14 HKT<br/>發佈時間：18:47 2026-11-14 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：18:47 2026-11-14 HKT</p><img alt=\"「旌採」跨季三連捷\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/ur/sthl_square/2f075ebc35a536565cc33a4196c17ffa/2026-11/r11_0.jpg\"/><p>姚本輝馬房的「旌採」今季大熟大勇，剛戰在田草千六米取得跨季連捷，今日升三班再跑同程，仍不足以構成阻礙，在騎師艾兆禮胯下再贏一場，取得三連捷，騎者起孖之餘，亦以二十四分，和何澤堯一同取得騎師王冠軍。</p><p>此外，伍鵬志則以三十分成為練馬師王冠軍。</p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T11:03:57.436637+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":202,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T10:47:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T10:57:23.685515+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T10:57:23.685515+00:00","content_hash":"cf8b9bd77f0edc39274d320207f47301af30fe74e12ea609eb3eba0123d60122","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}